@Portal.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Get All Users
GET {{Portal.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### Get User By ID
GET {{Portal.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Accept: application/json

###

### Create New User
POST {{Portal.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "passwordHash": "hashedpassword123",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Update User
PUT {{Portal.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe_updated",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "passwordHash": "hashedpassword123",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Delete User
DELETE {{Portal.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Accept: application/json

###
